:db/add "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132" :answer-field/choices "26427588-6cc2-574f-915e-cd5b4a60ee5c"] [:db/add "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132" :answer-field/choices "1f5a3a8d-9159-5f6c-b0b2-310b89c156ea"] [:db/add "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132" :answer-field/correct "26427588-6cc2-574f-915e-cd5b4a60ee5c"] [:db/add 17592186571390 :question/answer-fields "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132"] [:db/ensure "b2c0235c-7d19-55b5-90e7-00d89014f132" :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186571390 :question/validate] [:db/cas 17592186571405 :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$D=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $D$ is upper triangular\n\nII. $D$ is lower triangular\n\nIII. ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular" "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/cas 17592186571405 :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $D$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"." "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $D$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $D$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular: **True.** All the entries above the main diagonal of $D$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **True.** All the entries below the main diagonal of ${D}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{D}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- $D$ is lower triangular.\n- ${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular."] [:db/retract 17592186571405 :question/answer-fields 17592186571336] [:db/add "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f" :answer/id #uuid "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f"] [:db/add "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d" :answer/id #uuid "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d"] [:db/add "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4" :answer-field/id #uuid "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4"] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4" :answer-field/key "$D$ is upper triangular."] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4" :answer-field/choices "4aa535c5-18be-5291-ab2b-059585ddce1f"] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4" :answer-field/choices "f447b738-e578-52b3-84b1-48b30297476d"] [:db/add "524897be-28e9-5bf2-8fa1-3f99783ecab4"