dd "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07" :answer/id #uuid "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07"] [:db/add "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/id #uuid "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539"] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/key "${D}^{T}$ is upper triangular."] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/choices "41c8674e-08d3-5072-8aea-faf5c91f3c48"] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/choices "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07"] [:db/add "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/correct "5912d18b-80c7-574e-a0e3-e11ca2f23d07"] [:db/add 17592186571405 :question/answer-fields "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539"] [:db/ensure "0f2f6b81-6acc-5027-a70a-7986da500539" :answer-field/validate] [:db/ensure 17592186571405 :question/validate] [:db/cas 17592186571420 :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $B$ is upper triangular\n\nII. $B$ is lower triangular\n\nIII. ${B}^{T}+B$ is upper triangular" "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/cas 17592186571420 :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true, since the result of ${B}^{T}+B$ has all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}+B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only\"." "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- $B$ is upper triangular: **False.** This fails because $B$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **False.** This fails because $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${B}^{T}+B$ is upper triangular: **True.** This holds because the result of ${B}^{T}+B$ has all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}+B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe true statements are:\n\n- ${B}^{T}+B$ is upper triangular."] [:db/retract 17592186571420 :question/answer-fields 17592186571341] [:db/add "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97" :answer/id #uuid "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97"] [:db/add "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "b32eb6e4-ad48-52e9-8cec-78071c9a9b97" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346" :answer/id #uuid "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346"] [:db/add "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "2b6b8b0d-7ff0-59a0-9419-9bcc6dde0346" :answer/validate] [:db/add "199cbca1-cc20-522f-bcdb-3c7f1d2f207d" :answer-field/id #uuid "199cbca1-cc20-522f-bcdb-3c7f1d2f207d"] [:db/add "199cbca1-cc20-522f-bcdb-3c7f1d2f207d" :answer-field/key "$B$ is upper triangular."] 